ia","text":"High Base ATK and Physical DMG; mainly a stat stick for non-physical support builds."},{"name":"Emberwell","text":"Provides 165 EM and up to 32% ATK plus 32% Stellar Glimmer reaction DMG at R5, making it Odette’s strongest craftable 4-star option for personal damage"},{"name":"Finale of the Deep","text":"Provides 27.6% ATK and up to 24% additional ATK at R5, plus up to 300 flat ATK when its Bond of Life is cleared. A strong craftable 4-star option for Odette."},{"name":"Xiphos' Moonlight","text":"R 1 + Elemental Mastery Small ATK and Energy Recharge support option."},{"name":"Harbinger of Dawn","text":"R 1 + CRIT DMG Effective F2P CRIT DMG sword; keep HP above 90% to gain the 14% CRIT Rate bonus."}],"a":[{"names":["Heart of the Furnace"],"text":"Provides 18% ATK and boosts teamwide Stellar Glimmer DMG by 50% when the wearer triggers or deals Stellar Glimmer damage, making it one of Odette’s best-in-slot support sets.","stats":"ATK% · ATK% · CR/CD"},{"names":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"text":"Provides 18% ATK and boosts Stellar-Conduct DMG by 40%, with 16% CR against affected enemies. A strong personal-DMG set for Odette in Stellar-Conduct teams, especially when another teammate carries Heart of the Furnace.","stats":""},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"text":"Provides 36% ATK, making it a flexible option for boosting Odette’s personal damage.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Puppet Masters","members":["Odette","Sandrone","Yae Miko","Nicole"],"text":"Odette enables and buffs Stellar-Conduct, Sandrone drives on-field damage, Yae adds off-field Electro damage, and Nicole provides ATK buffs and shielding.","roles":["Stellar","Main DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Icebreaker","members":["Odette","Wriothesley","Yae Miko","Nicole"],"text":"Wriothesley drives on-field Stellar-Conduct damage, Odette enables and buffs Stellar-Conduct, Yae provides off-field Electro damage, and Nicole supplies ATK buffs and shielding.","roles":["Stellar","Main DPS","Off-Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Slumber Party","members":["Odette","Yumemizuki Mizuki","Traveler (Cryo)","Sucrose"],"text":"Mizuki drives on-field Stellar Swirl damage, Odette enables and buffs Stellar Swirl, Cryo Traveler provides off-field Cryo and reaction buffs, and Sucrose boosts EM and shreds RES.","roles":["Stellar","Main DPS","Cryo","EM Build"]},{"name":"Discount Detectives","members":["Odette","Shikanoin Heizou","Barbara","Fischl"],"text":"Heizou drives on-field Stellar Swirl damage, Odette provides off-field Cryo and enables Stellar Swirl, Fischl adds off-field Electro damage, and Barbara provides healing and Hydro application.","roles":["Stellar Support / Enabler","Anemo DPS","Support","Off-field"]}],"v":"Stellar-Conduct Enabler: Enable and buff reaction damage while applying Cryo off-field.\nPersonal Cryo Damage: Use a damage-focused artifact setup instead of maximum team buffs.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Stellar Support / Enabler"],"about":"Odette is a versatile Cryo support who enhances Stellar reactions with consistent off-field application, team buffs, and strong synergy with Anemo drivers.","pros":["Powerful Stellar reaction buffs","Reliable off-field Cryo","Enables strong team synergies","Flexible team compositions"],"cons":["Requires Stellar teammates","Limited non-Stellar value","Needs consistent reaction triggers"],"weapons":["Whitelake Frostfeather","Azurelight","Freedom-Sworn","Aquila Favonia","Emberwell","Finale of the Deep","Xiphos' Moonlight","Harbinger of Dawn"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Sub DPS"},{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Sub DPS"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Sub DPS"}],"main":["ATK%","ATK%","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["ATK: 2,000-3,000","Crit Rate: 50% - 60%","Crit DMG: 180%+","Energy Recharge: 120% - 140%"],"vars":[{"title":"Stellar-Conduct Enabler","role":"Support","weapons":["Whitelake Frostfeather","Emberwell"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize ER and support stats for rotation.","teams":"Electro ally triggering Stellar-Conduct.","when":"Enable and buff reaction damage while applying Cryo off-field.","cond":"Avoid duplicate Heart of the Furnace buffs.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Personal Cryo Damage","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Whitelake Frostfeather","Azurelight"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"Balance ATK, CRIT and ER.","teams":"Team that sustains Cryo reactions and needs extra damage.","when":"Use a damage-focused artifact setup instead of maximum team buffs.","cond":"More personal damage means fewer team utility bonuses.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Shivada Jade Sliver","Shivada Jade Fragment","Shivada Jade Chunk","Shivada Jade Gemstone","Unscorched Blossom Branch","Teachings of Charity","Guide to Charity","Philosophies of Charity","Ethereal Glimmershard","Ethereal Crystal","Ethereal Crystalscale Stone","Frostfairy Flower","Twisted Withered Branch","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Puppet Masters","members":["Odette","Sandrone","Yae Miko","Nicole"]},{"name":"Icebreaker","members":["Odette","Wriothesley","Yae Miko","Nicole"]},{"name":"Slumber Party","members":["Odette","Yumemizuki Mizuki","Traveler (Cryo)","Sucrose"]},{"name":"Discount Detectives","members":["Odette","Shikanoin Heizou","Barbara","Fischl"]}]}}],"title":"Odette","el":"Cryo"}